<title>USA: ICN gets 3 drug approvals in Canada.</title>
<headline>ICN gets 3 drug approvals in Canada.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICN Pharmaceuticals Inc said Canadian health authorities in December approved three of its pharmaceutical products.</p>
<p>They are Clonapam to treat seizures, and the anti-depressants Trazorel and Norventyl.</p>
</text>
